      "updated_at": "2019-09-04T04:46:26Z",
      "body": "Thanks for the kind suggestion.\r\n\r\nTo make it clear, I plan to collect the browser type / version and system type / version so that I can decide which browsers to support when considering new JavaScript features.\r\n\r\nI'm wondering if my words are improper or people just don't want anything to be collected? If the latter is true, I think I can remove that plan and just drop support for old browsers in the future.",
