      "created_at": "2019-09-04T13:28:18Z",
      "updated_at": "2019-09-04T13:28:18Z",
      "body": ">To make it clear, I plan to collect the browser type / version and system type / version so that I can decide which browsers to support when considering new JavaScript features.\r\n\r\nYes but I agree with them, I understand your reasoning but a lot of people who are privacy conscious simply want to minimize/deny data collection, and I think it's a good idea to either have it disabled by default and allow people to opt-in or the other way around, or even better just completely disable it. I genuinely think this would be a good descision. ",
